  description: "I killed a man today. He tried to take my backpack with the last
    of my food. He wasn't even infected, he didn't even have a real weapon\u2026
    I used to be the kind of guy who would help him, but today I just did it without
    hesitation. I'm sorry, Darling. I'm becoming just like them, but I have to survive
    to find you."
